{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Virtual pet dragon! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dragon egg is waiting just for you! Choose who to bring home and take care of your new companion to make it grow bigger and fiercer.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/HatchingExtraLongCompressed.gif?t=1743172058\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mini Games! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your dragon loves to play! Earn coins and beat your high scores together. Unlock new mini-games as your dragon grows!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/HurdleExtraLongCompressed.gif?t=1743172058\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fidget toys! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bored at work? With the wide range of toys available in your backpack you will always find something to do. Combine multiple toys for a real sandbox experience.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/FidgetPlayLongCompressed.gif?t=1743172058\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite friends for a playdate and watch your screen come to life. Unlock multiplayer mini games. Compete with and against your friends and their dragons.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/extras/MultiplayerCompressed.gif?t=1743172058\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586770?t=1743172058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586770?t=1743172058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586770/b54b8e04e1e2face8786f1ed75a4ed146b80cb8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743172058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store